OL,3,AGas bill standing charges to be
OL,4,Ascrapped, chancellor says ahead of
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,8,F"moves money and power out of
OL,9,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,10,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,11,Fgovernment borrowing
OL,13,FMeanwhile, this first Budget of Andy
OL,14,FBurnham's premiership will include a
OL,15,Fminimum wage increase, though the BBC
OL,16,Funderstands 18- to 20-year-olds are set
OL,17,Fto see lower increases than in previous
OL,18,Fyears
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
